  "emitters_from": "RenderKanturu1stObjectVisual type 95 (GM_Kanturu_1st.cpp:361-381): a BITMAP_SPARK+1 (Effect/Spark03) at each of bones 0-9, Scale 7.5 (in `high`), light (0.1, 0.1, 0.3), added. The crystal holds one key, so the points are its rig's rest positions (MuExtract export-rig of MuMain's Object96.bmd, every bone a root), in MU units in the model's frame. Drawn by game/world/crystal_sparks.h. Its RENDER_CHROME7 | RENDER_DARK pass is not carried.",
